  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing Politically Motivated Violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to contribute to the prevention and mitigation of politically motivated violence through the people-to-people peacebuilding approaches in western area rural, Kambia, Bombali, Karene and Kono districts. The specific objective of the project is to empower women and youth to have increased voice and leadership as peacebuilders and actively contribute to the strengthening of peace infrastructure at local and national levels.</narrative>
  </description>
